-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",118,{
[3745]="70065DAC\n1\tDefeat Lhingar trappers (total: 8)\030Defeat Lhingar hunters (total: 8)\030Defeat Lhingar queen\tArlach has asked you to investigate Lhingar across the river to the north-west.\n2\tTalk to Arlach\tYou found the spider's nest in Lhingar and have defeated many spiders, including their queen. You should tell Arlach the news. Arlach is in Arnach.\n",
[3746]="7000887D\n1\tDefeat Cragstone-spiders (total: 10)\tThe Cragstone-spiders can be found in the crags west of Tol Ascarnen, beyond the tower Lugazag in the shadow of Dâr-gazag. Quartermaster Cynwiss asked you to defeat the Cragstone-spiders in the moors of the Steps of Gram.\n2\tReturn to Quartermaster Cynwiss at Tol Ascarnen\tQuartermast Cynwiss awaits your return at Tol Ascarnen. You made your way into the moors in the Steps of Gram and slaughtered a host of the Cragstone-spiders.\n",
[3747]="70022B2B\n1\tDefeat Crawling Arms (total: 20)\tCrawling Arms can be found within the Maze Wing of the Great Barrow.\n",
[3748]="70047AE0\n1\tEnter the Towers of the Teeth\tThe Towers of the Teeth are located in the Slag-hills. You should defeat crawlers in the Towers of the Teeth.\n2\tDefeat crawlers in the Towers of the Teeth (total: 10)\tThe Towers of the Teeth are located in the Slag-hills. You should defeat crawlers in the Towers of the Teeth.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated many crawlers in the Towers of the Teeth.\n",
[3749]="70047CF0\n1\tDefeat blighted marsh-lurkers (total: 2)\030Defeat scavenging crebain (total: 4)\030Defeat ravenous marsh-toads (total: 4)\030Defeat Dead Marsh avanc (total: 2)\030Defeat swarming marsh-flies (total: 4)\030Defeat marsh corpse-flies (total: 4)\tCreatures from the Dead Marshes have ventured into the muddy border of the Noman-lands. You should destroy any of these creatures you find while scouting in the Noman-lands.\n2\tReturn to Legolas\tLegolas can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien. You should talk to Legolas and tell how you have cleansed many blighted creatures from the borders of the Dead Marshes.\n",
[3750]="70067EF1\n1\tCollect debts from sullen indebted workers ([see journal]/5)\tUlanor instructed you to collect debts from five workers that are behind on their credit. Something seems off. The workers are in the nearby area.\n2\tSpeak with Foreman Nûrut\tThe worker expressed that there is no way that he could pay his debts and that he wanted you to speak with the foreman. You can find Foreman Nûrut in Rakhatâb.\n3\tSell the pearl to Elbatra in Rakhatâb\tThe foreman directed you to the shoreline surrounding Rakhatâb to search for a monstrous crab that defends a great treasure. Once you have recovered the treasure, you are to take it and sell it to a merchant with a penchant for very fine things in Rakhatâb.\n4\tDeliver the payment to Overseer Ulanor in Rakhatâb\tWith enough coin to pay the overseer you should return to her in western Rakhatâb and tell her that the worker's debts were paid in full.\n",
[3751]="70046C22\n1\tDefeat defilers along the Ephel Dúath (total: 8)\030Destroy Dúath-spires (total: 8)\tDefilers and Dúath-spires can be found along the edges of the Mountains of Shadow in south-eastern North Ithilien. Thurindol has asked you to defeat the defilers invading North Ithilien and destroy the black stone spires to which they are drawn.\n2\tTalk to Thurindol at Aelin Veren\tThurindol can be found at Aelin Veren. You have defeated the defilers and thrown down the Dúath-spires. You should return to Thurindol with news of your success.\n",
[3752]="7000A9DF\n1\tPresent your Crests of Valour to Hróar at Gath Forthnír\030Craft Crests of Valour (total: 5)\tHróar is at Gath Forthnír in Angmar. Hróar has asked you to craft some Crests of Valour and bring them to him.\n",
[3753]="7000A9D1\n1\tPresent your Crests of Vigilance to Hróar at Gath Forthnír\030Craft Crests of Vigilance (total: 5)\tHróar is at Gath Forthnír in Angmar. Hróar has asked you to craft some Crests of Vigilance and bring them to him.\n",
[3754]="7000D4E4\n1\tDefeat Iarvael\tThe merrevail hunt throughout Himbar, the lands west of Gath Forthnír. Thoriel has asked you to remove the lieutenant, Iarvael, from the morroval caverns.\n2\tTalk to Thoriel\tThoriel waits for you in Gath Forthnír, the hidden Ranger-camp east of Himbar. You have defeated Iorvael and should now return to Thoriel with news of your victory.\n",
[3755]="7006F086\n1\tStop looters (total: 6)\tBâdarul fears that Ekhamâti soldiers have escaped the fighting and made their way into the area. They are now looting and causing chaos and must be stopped.\n2\tReturn to Bâdarul in Iridír\tReturn to Bâdarul in Iridír and inform him that you have successfully dealt with the looters causing trouble in the area.\n",
[3756]="7002EB33\n1\tCollect stolen goods from brigands\tCattle and other stolen goods can be found in the brigand encampment in the northern Wold. You should free the cattle and collect the stolen goods from the brigands.\n2\tFree cattle from their tethers (total: 3)\030Collect stolen coins from brigands (total: 6)\030Collect stolen grain (total: 6)\tCattle and other stolen goods can be found in the brigand encampment in the northern Wold. You should free the cattle and collect the stolen goods from the brigands.\n3\tBring the stolen goods back to their rightful owner\tThe farmer is at his farm between Langhold and the brigands' encampment. You should return the stolen goods to the farmer, who is much poorer after the robbery by brigands.\n",
[3757]="7003081C\n1\tDefeat Thauk\tYou have overheard Orcs of Mordor uttering a particular name - a name that can only belong to their leader. Thauk can be found deep in the Orc camp to the south of Walstow.\n2\tDefeat Thauk\tThauk can be found deep in the Orc camp to the south of Walstow.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Thauk and shattered the leadership of the invading Mordor Orcs.\n",
[3758]="7006B767\n1\tEnter the village of Eshadûr\tDalagín, the Dumûri captain, has asked you to enter Eshadûr and disrupt the Ordâkhai operations there.\n2\tDefeat Ordâkhai in Eshadûr (total: 12)\030Destroy Ordâkhai boats (total: 4)\030Scout the western store-house\030Scout the eastern officers' tent\030Scout the southern stables\tDalagín, the Dumûri captain, has asked you to enter Eshadûr and destroy their boats, defeat Ordâkhai soldiers, and scout a few locations.\n3\tTalk to Dalagín in Iridír\tYou have completed your mission in Eshadûr and should return to Dalagín in Iridír.\n4\tTalk to Girhâzi\tYou have completed your mission there and reported back to Dalagín, the Dumûri captain, in Iridír. She has asked you to go to Girhâzi and tell her of the waggons laden with black powder.\n",
[3759]="70037160\n1\tYou should defeat the ambassadors from the Dunlending clans and the half-orcs.\t\n2\tDefeat Urig\030Defeat Brin\030Defeat Drustan\030Defeat Arwel\030Defeat Thauk\tThe Dunlending and half-orc ambassadors may be found throughout the encampment at Torsbury. You should defeat the ambassadors from the Dunlending clans and the half-orcs.\n",
[3760]="7003EBE3\n1\tDefeat toads in Tâl Bruinen (total: 10)\tThere are toads infesting the waterways of Tâl Bruinen, in the Trollshaws. While in Tâl Bruinen, you should purge the waterways of the foul toads.\n",
[3761]="7006840C\n1\tCollect crocodile hides ([see journal]/12)\030Collect crocodile meat ([see journal]/12)\tDemand remains high for the trappings obtained by hunting crocodiles. Go to the shore east of the expedition camp, hunt the crocodiles for their hides and meat.\n2\tCollect crocodile hides ([see journal]/12)\030Collect crocodile meat ([see journal]/12)\tYou collected meat and hides from the crocodiles along the shore. Return them to Tevurin at the hunter's expedition camp in southeastern Cape of Umbar.\n",
[3762]="70068342\n1\tCollect crocodile underbelly skins ([see journal]/6)\030Collect tough crocodile hides ([see journal]/6)\tTevurin directed you to the shore south and east of the expedition camp in search of crocodile skins. He needs the soft underbelly skins and the tough hides from the backs of the crocodiles there.\n2\tDeliver the hides to Tevurin\tYou collected the soft underbelly and tougher hides of crocodiles. Take the hides and return to Tevurin at the hunter's expedition in the southeast of the Cape of Umbar.\n",
[3763]="700663A6\n1\tDiscover the Bolt-holes\tBrigands are stockpiling crossbow bolts in the Bolt-holes.\n2\tCollect quivers of crossbow bolts (total: 8)\tBrigands are stockpiling crossbow bolts in the Bolt-holes. Collect quivers of crossbow bolts.\n3\tTalk to Laerind\tYou have collected many quivers of crossbow bolts, and should deliver them to someone in Ethring. Deliver the crossbow bolts to someone in Ethring.\n",
[3764]="700332E6\n1\tSummon Svanr using the summoning horn when you are ready to leave\tThe summoning horn can be found near the Bridge of Khazad-dûm, behind Svanr in Nud-melek. You should summon Svanr to your side when you are ready to leave.\n2\tFind a good place to rest (use the horn to call Svanr to your side)\tA good place to rest can likely be found near Sudulthurkh, the northern cross-roads of Nud-melek. Svanr can be summoned using the horn he gave you. You should make your way east across Nud-melek by heading north of the great chasm.\n3\tTalk to Svanr at Sudulthurkh\tSvanr is at the cross-roads of Sudulthurkh in north-eastern Nud-melek. You should speak with Svanr.\n",
[3765]="7004186B\n1\tTravel south to Aerthir\tAerthir can be found far to the south of Ost Anglebed in Lebennin. Nimithil has asked you to aid the people of Aerthir and seek out a strange man taking refuge in the settlement.\n2\tTalk to the strange man in Aerthir\tThe strange man can be found somewhere in Aerthir. You have arrived in Aerthir and should now seek the strange man that dwells there.\n",
[3766]="70020BAC\n1\tTalk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair\tThere are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair to the north-east of the stag-corpse. You should bring the rack of antlers you harvested to one of the Rangers of the Grey Company.\n",
[3767]="7006EB91\n1\tSpeak with Surâsh in southern Imhûlar\tSpeak with Surâsh at the site of the missing scouts. The site can be found south-east of Urmâkh, near Zahûmakh.\n2\tScout the area south-east near Zahûmakh for signs of the scouts\tScout the area around Zahûmakh to the south-east where the scouts were last seen.\n3\tExamine the first scout\030Examine the second scout\030Examine the third scout\tExamine the scouts for clues of the cause of their untimely end.\n4\tFind the first clue as to the scouts' death\030Find the second clue as to the scouts' death\030Find a third clue as to the scouts' death\tExamine the area around the scouts for more clues as to their demise, and their assailants.\n5\tExamine the strange banner nearby\tExamine the strange banner near the scouts.\n6\tCollect the strange banner\tCollect the strange banner.\n7\tSpeak with Surâsh in southern Imhûlar\tSpeak with Surâsh in southern Imhûlar.\n8\tBring the clues and banner to Mizâdi in Urmâkh\tBring the clues and banner to Mizâdi in Urmâkh.\n",
[3768]="70025A7D\n1\tHave a look around\030Climb the peak of the colossus\tThe rope to climb the colossus is nearby. Make your way to the top of the colossus and have a look.\n2\tTalk to Sardan near the colossus\tSardan is at the base of the colossus. Sardan will be interested to hear what you have seen.\n",
[3769]="70050A17\n1\tDisarm Ungoladan-traps\tCrude traps have been hidden around Óinsbridge.\n2\tDisarm Ungoladan-traps (total: 10)\tCrude traps have been hidden around Óinsbridge by the Ungoledain. They should be disarmed in order to allow safe passage for travelling dwarves.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have disarmed many traps at Óinsbridge.\n",
[3770]="70028C9F\n1\tBring the cruel barb to Garrun in the Isendale\tGarrun is at his camp, west of Cuvnerth. You should bring the cruel barb to Garrun.\n",
[3771]="70035679\n1\tDestroy Orc-axes (total: 8)\tIsengard wood-cutters can be found in south-west Balewood near Finglas' Mead. Mossbeard has asked that you break the cruel axes of the Orcs in the Balewood to prevent further harm from coming to the trees and his kind.\n2\tTalk to Mossbeard\tMossbeard can be found following you, or if you have become separated, he can be called with your whistle. You have defeated many Orcs and destroyed their vile tools. You should now speak to Mossbeard and see if he has more tasks for you.\n",
[3772]="7002C2D2\n1\tDestroy forbidden traps (total: 8)\tTraps can be found on the north-western edge of Thinglad's trees, set by the huntsmen of Stangard. You should destroy the traps, for they are not permitted in the Elf-lands.\n2\tReturn to Noriel in Haldirith\tNoriel is awaiting you in Thinglad's Elf-keep of Haldirith. You should return to Noriel, now that you have destroyed the unlawfully-placed traps.\n",
[3773]="70027257\n1\tDestroy Orc-traps in the South Gravenwood (total: 5)\tAndreg has asked you to help him find and disable Orc-traps throughout the South Gravenwood.\n2\tTalk to Andreg\tYou should speak with Andreg regarding the traps you disabled.\n",
[3774]="70018F81\n1\tBring Orc weapons to Maethoron\030Collect Orc Weapons (total: 5)\tThe Orcs have established three camps along the road that runs through Nanduhirion, north-west of Talan Haldir. Racks of weapons can be found throughout these camps. Maethoron has asked you to steal Orc-weapons from the camps of the Orcs in Nanduhirion.\n",
[3775]="7002272A\n1\tDefeat Brathach\030Defeat Gogulch\030Defeat Glewlûd\030Defeat Tuisog\tThe giant-thanes may be found among the ruins on the southern edge of Thrór's Coomb. Frithgeir has asked you to seek out and defeat each of Gunnberg's thanes.\n2\tTalk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund\tFrithgeir is at Zudrugund, north of the giant-ruins. You should bring news of your victory to Frithgeir.\n",
[3776]="70053F21\n1\tRepair crumbling ramparts in Díngarth (total: 10)\tDíngarth's crumbling ramparts are in need of repair.\n2\tTalk to Gelvira\tGelvira can be found in Díngarth. You should talk to Gelvira.\n",
})
